   "last_activity_utc": "2011-03-17T13:15:59Z",
   "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5",
   "body_html": "<p>Consider:</p>\n\n<pre><code>void f() {\n  str *s = (str *)malloc(sizeof(str));\n  s-&gt;len = 5;\n  s-&gt;alloclen = 5;\n  s-&gt;buf = strdup(\"Hello\");\n  strnappend(&amp;s, \" World!\", 7);\n  free(s); /* courtesy of Eric */\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>If you had something like that, the memory allocated by <code>realloc()</code> would leak as <code>f()</code> is left.</p>\n"
  },
