   "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5",
   "body_html": "<p>Like this mtrace said \"No memory leaks\"</p>\n\n<pre><code>char *strnappnd(str **s, const char *buf, size_t n) {\n    ...\n    return (*s)-&gt;buf;\n}\nvoid strfree(str *s){\n    free(s-&gt;buf);\n    free(s);\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>using the sample code given by Frerich</p>\n\n<pre><code>void f() {\n  str *s = (str *)malloc(sizeof(str));\n  s-&gt;len = 5;\n  s-&gt;alloclen = 5;\n  s-&gt;buf = strdup(\"Hello\");\n  s-&gt;buf = strnappend(&amp;s, \" World!\", 7);\n  strfree(s);\n}\n</code></pre>\n"
