   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "How do you detect the leak? With what tool? I had once (don&#39;t remember the name) a tool that lost track of <code>realloced</code> pointers when the pointer changed. <code>realloc</code> can return the old pointer or a new one and that tool thought the old pointer was then lost. It was a bug of the tool, not of the code. Your code looks ok so far."
  }
